    <item rdf:about="https://hybridsky.org/w/recipes/thai_curry_chicken?rev=1626877414&amp;do=diff">
        <dc:format>text/html</dc:format>
        <dc:date>2021-07-21T10:23:34-0400</dc:date>
        <dc:creator>faith (faith@undisclosed.example.com)</dc:creator>
        <title>recipes:thai_curry_chicken - created</title>
        <link>https://hybridsky.org/w/recipes/thai_curry_chicken?rev=1626877414&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>Thai Curry Chicken

(This is based on Thira's recipe from the late 1980's.)

Ingredients

	*  4 potatoes, diced
	*  2 sweet onions, diced
	*  1 pound boneless skinless chicken breast, diced
	*  1 head of garlic, minced
	*  1 4oz can curry (e.g., Maesri brand panang, or other)</description>
    </item>
