        <link>https://hybridsky.org/w/recipes/chocolate_peanut_butter_cake?rev=1620488428&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>Chocolate Peanut Butter Cake
(Epicurious)

YIELDMakes 16 servings

INGREDIENTS

Chocolate cake:

	*  Nonstick vegetable oil spray
	*  1 1/4 cups all-purpose flour
	*  1 cup sugar
	*  3/4 cup natural unsweetened cocoa powder
	*  1 1/2 teaspoons kosher salt</description>
    </item>
